---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — SizeToolsHub"
  description="SizeToolsHub's privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information. We are committed to your privacy and data security."
  canonicalUrl="https://sizetoolshub.com/privacy/"
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-20">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline-soft mb-6 shadow-2xs">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="prose-custom space-y-10 text-text-muted">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">1. Overview</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          SizeToolsHub ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit <strong class="text-ink">sizetoolshub.com</strong> and any related subdomains or services.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mt-3">
          By using our website, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2">2.1 Automatically Collected Data</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When you visit our website, we may automatically collect certain technical information through our analytics provider (Cloudflare Web Analytics), including:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Browser type and version</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Operating system</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Pages visited and time spent on pages</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Referring URLs</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Approximate geographic location (country/region level)</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
          <strong class="text-ink">We use Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong>, which is privacy-first and cookieless. It does not track individuals across websites, does not use cookies, and does not collect personally identifiable information.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 mt-6">2.2 Local Storage</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We use browser <code class="bg-canvas-soft px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono">localStorage</code> to save your theme preference (light/dark mode) and any size card data you choose to save. This data is stored entirely on your device and is never transmitted to our servers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2 mt-6">2.3 Information You Voluntarily Provide</h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We do not currently operate contact forms, newsletters, or user account systems. We do not collect names, email addresses, or other personal information from visitors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-3">The limited analytical data we collect is used exclusively to:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Understand which tools and pages are most useful to visitors</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Improve website performance and content</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Diagnose technical issues</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Monitor overall traffic patterns</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
          We do <strong class="text-ink">not</strong> sell, trade, or transfer your information to third parties. We do not use your data for advertising or marketing purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          SizeToolsHub does <strong class="text-ink">not</strong> use tracking cookies. Our analytics provider (Cloudflare Web Analytics) is cookieless by design. We use browser <code class="bg-canvas-soft px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono">localStorage</code> — not cookies — for storing your theme and size preferences.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-3">We use the following third-party services:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-ink">Cloudflare</strong> — CDN, hosting, and privacy-first web analytics. No cookies, no personal data collection. <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">Cloudflare Privacy Policy ↗</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong class="text-ink">Google Fonts</strong> — We load the Inter typeface from Google Fonts. Google may collect limited technical data. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy ↗</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">6. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          SizeToolsHub is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will delete it promptly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Since we do not collect personally identifiable information, there is generally no personal data to access, correct, or delete. If you have stored data in your browser's localStorage (such as size preferences), you can clear this at any time through your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can reach us at <strong class="text-ink">sizetoolshub.com</strong>. We aim to respond to all inquiries within 5 business days.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer nav -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-hairline-soft flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm text-text-muted">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">← Back to Home</a>
      <a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">About Us</a>
    </div>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
